{"2831270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chiaroscuro", "steam_appid": 2831270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831270/extras/462349bece7d97a25cc81a15c93f9692.poster.avif?t=1775452886\" width=616 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831270/extras/462349bece7d97a25cc81a15c93f9692.webm?t=1775452886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831270/extras/462349bece7d97a25cc81a15c93f9692.mp4?t=1775452886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Chiaroscuro</strong> invites you into a world where light and shadow dictate reality. Navigate through mind-bending puzzles, embracing the power of shadows to uncover an ancient myth. The narrative unfolds across an ancient island where the balance of light and shadow has been disrupted by the sun god’s corrupted energy. With stunning visuals, your mastery of chiaroscuro shapes the destiny of a universe on the brink.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831270/extras/980e38a2b7fad8cc295e7cbcfb6bc609.poster.avif?t=1775452886\" width=616 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831270/extras/980e38a2b7fad8cc295e7cbcfb6bc609.webm?t=1775452886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831270/extras/980e38a2b7fad8cc295e7cbcfb6bc609.mp4?t=1775452886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embrace the Shadows for Survival and Exploration</h2>Utilize shadows for exploration and survival, moving objects via their shadows and traversing walls in a 2D shadow dimension. Evade corrupted cult members by smartly stealth through the darkness.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831270/extras/eda7db0eac0216391f972a19878bda77.poster.avif?t=1775452886\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831270/extras/eda7db0eac0216391f972a19878bda77.webm?t=1775452886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831270/extras/eda7db0eac0216391f972a19878bda77.mp4?t=1775452886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manipulate Light to Shape Reality</h2>Control light sources and mirrors to transform shadows into tangible objects or reveal hidden paths. Solve dynamic puzzles in an ever-changing world where your manipulation of light dictates the progression.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831270/extras/2d4a8ec1c94cda6f7b5ab22e21b97b8a.poster.avif?t=1775452886\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831270/extras/2d4a8ec1c94cda6f7b5ab22e21b97b8a.webm?t=1775452886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831270/extras/2d4a8ec1c94cda6f7b5ab22e21b97b8a.mp4?t=1775452886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore the lost balance</h2>Collect the fragments of 'the Timepiece' and rewind time itself. Mend the rift between the sun and shadow deities, restoring the world's equilibrium.<br><br>Join our official Discord community to participate in playtests, share your ideas, and more!", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">